## 🚀 **Deployment Instructions**

### **1. Update Railway Environment Variables**

Add these **new** variables to your existing ones:
```
SESSION_SECRET=generate-a-random-32-char-string
PORTAL_PASSWORD=YourSecurePassword123!
NODE_ENV=production
```

### **2. File Structure (make sure all files are in correct locations)**
```
your-project/
├── src/
│   ├── accident.html
│   ├── alerts.html
│   ├── insurance.html
│   ├── menu.html
│   ├── report-issue.html
│   ├── success.html
│   ├── video.html
│   ├── Final-01.jpg
│   ├── icon.jpg
│   ├── fleet.jpg
│   ├── issue.jpg
│   ├── accident.jpg
│   ├── insurance.jpg
│   ├── amazon.pdf
│   ├── hertz.pdf
│   └── Panel_of_Physicians.pdf
├── index.js (NEW - replace your current one)
├── package.json (NEW)
├── sw.js (NEW)
├── manifest.json (NEW)
├── login.html (NEW)
└── .env (for local development only)
